  "title": "India's GST Reforms and ITC Expansion",
  "summary": "India's GST reforms aim to expand input tax credit (ITC) coverage for businesses across sectors, including motor vehicles and energy, while addressing tax disparities and encouraging wider coverage. The reforms include provisions for group health and life insurance, with potential tax benefits for electric vehicles. These measures are expected to enhance tax efficiency and reduce compliance burdens.",
  "facts": [
